From b2fcee1583ca8c26062b89a92a9a8a94791101a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian MacDonald <ian@netstatz.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 23:06:02 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 007/109] feat(tflite): add a TFLite classification backend
 (tflite-server subprocess)

Serves /v1/classify through tflite-server, which speaks ort-server's /classify
contract on a LiteRT engine: same model directory layout (with model.tflite),
same manifest rules and scores. Like litert, the binary is a pre-installed
tflite-server on PATH. lemond passes --weight-cache next to the model so
XNNPACK keeps one packed copy of the weights mapped from disk instead of one
anonymous copy per signature.

Assisted-by: claude:opus-5.5
